&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bodge
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;(British Slang) A quick and dirty job, something done very hastily. Make it look good for the next day or two and if it falls down after that, it&amp;rsquo;s alright.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.urbandictionary.com/define.php?term=bodge&#34;&gt;https://www.urbandictionary.com/define.php?term=bodge&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
